  

<h2 id="and-why-are-you-idolising-the-stuff-that-makes-you-sad">And why are you idolising the stuff that makes you sad?</h2>
<p><em>This post represents a change in topic from the bulk of what I write. To help you distinguish the plain text productivity themes at a glance from those that are more overtly Christ-centred, look for the sparkle ✨ emoji in the title.</em></p>
